{
  "slug": "sp-global",
  "name": "S&P Global",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "S&P Global - Financial data and analytics skills including company tearsheets, earnings previews, and transaction summaries",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `earnings-preview-beta` (Generate a concise 4-5 page equity research earnings preview for a single company), `funding-digest` (Generate a polished one-page PowerPoint slide summarizing key takeaways from recent funding rounds and notable capital markets activity…), `tear-sheet` (Generate professional company tear sheets using S&P Capital IQ data via the Kensho LLM-ready API MCP server)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `spglobal`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install sp-global@knowledge-work-plugins` from `kensho-technologies/spglobal-agent-skills` (`plugins/spglobal-plugin`).",
